; --- THE HAMMER: an area slam that shakes the ground. Everything in the shockwave round its quarry is
; hit, slowed and jolted, and enemy bolts inside it are crushed (SpiritualWeapon.HammerSlamRadius). Goes
; for the densest knot in reach. Level 7: 25 a slam from two hammers every 1.06 s, reach +30%,
; slowed 40% for 1.6 s.

